  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/IMG_4608.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Los ni&ntilde;os y las ni&ntilde;as que participan en <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=42878\" target=\"_blank\">las Christmas FunWeeks de Kids&amp;Us, school of english en la plaza Corts Valencianes, 9 de Onda</a>, han disfrutado este martes de un breakfast saludable, que pod&iacute;an comprar con sus billetes propios en el market instalado all&iacute; mismo y atendido por sus tres profesoras, siempre en ingl&eacute;s.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/beakfastsaludablekidsampusonda/img_4603.jpg\" alt=\"img_4603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/beakfastsaludablekidsampusonda/img_4604.jpg\" alt=\"img_4604\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/beakfastsaludablekidsampusonda/img_4606.jpg\" alt=\"img_4606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/beakfastsaludablekidsampusonda/img_4607.jpg\" alt=\"img_4607\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/beakfastsaludablekidsampusonda/img_4608.jpg\" alt=\"img_4608\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/beakfastsaludablekidsampusonda/img_4609.jpg\" alt=\"img_4609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/beakfastsaludablekidsampusonda/img_4611.jpg\" alt=\"img_4611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/beakfastsaludablekidsampusonda/img_4613.jpg\" alt=\"img_4613\" style=\"max-width